    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There Is No Escape (TINE) Is a 2D Puzzle-platformer built in Clickteam Fusion 2.5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calvin, a 16-year-old boy, is working at 'The Facility' as a technician. His father used to work there as well before his death. Calvin wanted to find answers.<br><br>Everything he found pointed towards 'The Announcer' to be the one to blame for his father's death.<br><br>Using his hacking skills, he hacks into a robot that was scheduled to start a platforming testing track to try and get close to The Announcer without any danger to himself.<br><br>Eventually he teams up with someone named Lena to try and bring down the evil Announcer once and for all!<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Platforming</strong> - Experience the old platforming mechanics that were common with old flash games! Built for Keyboard and even Controllers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Voiced Story</strong> - Calvin, Lena, and The Announcer are fully voiced and ready to help expand the world of TINE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong> - Each level has secrets, make sure to explore around, you never know what might affect your ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And much much more!</strong> - Play the game to find out additional exciting things that are featured in this game!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There Is No Escape (TINE) Is a 2D Puzzle-platformer built in Clickteam Fusion 2.5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calvin, a 16-year-old boy, is working at 'The Facility' as a technician. His father used to work there as well before his death. Calvin wanted to find answers.<br><br>Everything he found pointed towards 'The Announcer' to be the one to blame for his father's death.<br><br>Using his hacking skills, he hacks into a robot that was scheduled to start a platforming testing track to try and get close to The Announcer without any danger to himself.<br><br>Eventually he teams up with someone named Lena to try and bring down the evil Announcer once and for all!<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Platforming</strong> - Experience the old platforming mechanics that were common with old flash games! Built for Keyboard and even Controllers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Voiced Story</strong> - Calvin, Lena, and The Announcer are fully voiced and ready to help expand the world of TINE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong> - Each level has secrets, make sure to explore around, you never know what might affect your ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And much much more!</strong> - Play the game to find out additional exciting things that are featured in this game!</p></li></ul>",
